1. c4 b6 2. Nc3 Bb7 3. e4 e6 4. d3 Nf6 5. Nf3 Bb4 6. Bd2 O-O 7. a3 Be7 8. Be2
d6 9. O-O Nbd7 10. h3 c5 11. Qc2 Ne5 12. Be3 Nfd7 13. Nh2 Nc6 14. f4 Bf6 15.
Nf3 a6 16. Bd1 Rb8 17. Qf2 b5 18. cxb5 axb5 19. Nxb5 Ba6 20. a4 Bxb5 21. axb5
Rxb5 22. e5 dxe5 23. Ba4 exf4 24. Bxb5 fxe3 25. Qxe3 Nd4 26. Bxd7 Qxd7 27. Ne5
Qd5 28. Ng4 Bg5 29. Qe5 Qxe5 30. Nxe5 Be3+ 31. Kh2 Nc2 32. Ra7 f6 33. Nc4 Bd4
34. Re7 Nb4 35. Rd1 f5 36. Kg3 Rf6 37. Kf3 h5 38. h4 Rg6 39. g3 Nd5 40. Re8+
Kh7 41. Re1 Nb4 42. R1xe6 Rxe6 43. Rxe6 {The next half-move is missing from
the bulletin but probably has to be} Nxd3 44. b3 Bf6 45. Ke3 Nc1 46. Rb6 Bc3
47. Kf3 Bb4 48. Ne3 Nxb3 49. Nxf5 Nc1 50. Rc6 Nb3 51. Rb6 Nc1 52. Ke3 Bc3 53.
Rb5 Bb4 54. Nd6 Nb3 55. Rb7 Nc1 56. Ne4 Kg6 57. Rc7 Nb3 58. Kf4 Nd4 59. Ke5
Nf3+ {Now the bulletin gives an illegal move 60 Nxc5 followed by 60...Bxc5 61
Rxc5 Kf5 62 Kd4 Kg4 63 Ke3 1-0, which is tricky to interpret. Perhaps a pair
of moves are missing, e.g.} 60. Kd5 Nh2 ({If} 60... Ba3 61. Nxc5 Bxc5 62. Rxc5
Kf5 {then 63 Kd4 would be illegal}) ({If} 60... Ne1 61. Nxc5 Bxc5 62. Rxc5 Kf5
63. Kd4+ Kg4 {when} 64. Rg5+ {seems much more likely than 64 Ke3.}) 61. Nxc5
Bxc5 62. Rxc5 Kf5 63. Kd4+ Kg4 64. Rg5+ (64. Ke3 {being highly improbable}) 1-0

